  ('MIA001', 'Made in Abyss', 'Akihito Tsukushi', 'Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi', 'In an age when the corners of the world have been scoured for their secrets, only one place remains unexplored--a massive cave system known as the Abyss, filled with monstrous creatures and lost relics. Those who delve into its depths are known as Cave Raiders. A young orphan named Riko dreams of following in her mother''s footsteps as a Cave Raider, and when she meets a strange robot while exploring the Abyss, she is one perilous step closer to achieving her goal!', 23, 'Vol 1', 'images/mia_vol_1.jpg', 'manga', 'Seven Seas Entertainment', 'abyss, exploration', 10, 192, '2012-10-01'),
  ('MIA002', 'Made in Abyss', 'Akihito Tsukushi', 'Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi', 'In an age when the corners of the world have been scoured for their secrets, only one place remains unexplored--a massive cave system known as the Abyss, filled with monstrous creatures and lost relics. Those who delve into its depths are known as Cave Raiders. A young orphan named Riko dreams of following in her mother''s footsteps as a Cave Raider, and when she meets a strange robot while exploring the Abyss, she is one perilous step closer to achieving her goal!', 23, 'Vol 2', 'images/mia_vol_2.jpg', 'manga', 'Seven Seas Entertainment', 'abyss, exploration', 10, 192, '2013-02-01'),
  ('COTE001', 'Classroom of the Elite', 'Shōgo Kinugasa', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'Students of the prestigious Tokyo Metropolitan Advanced Nurturing High School are given remarkable freedom--if they can win, barter, or save enough points to work their way up the ranks! Ayanokoji Kiyotaka has landed at the bottom in the scorned Class D, where he meets Horikita Suzune, who''s determined to rise up the ladder to Class A. Can they beat the system in a school where cutthroat competition is the name of the game?', 14, 'Vol 1', 'images/cote_vol_1.jpg', 'light novel', 'Seven Seas Entertainment', 'school, manipulation, elite, psychological', 10, 192, '2019-02-07'),
  ('COTE002', 'Classroom of the Elite', 'Shōgo Kinugasa', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'Students of the prestigious Tokyo Metropolitan Advanced Nurturing High School are given remarkable freedom--if they can win, barter, or save enough points to work their way up the ranks! Ayanokoji Kiyotaka has landed at the bottom in the scorned Class D, where he meets Horikita Suzune, who''s determined to rise up the ladder to Class A. Can they beat the system in a school where cutthroat competition is the name of the game?', 14, 'Vol 2', 'images/cote_vol_2.jpg', 'light novel', 'Seven Seas Entertainment', 'school, manipulation, elite, psychological', 10, 192, '2019-06-11'),
  ('MOR001', 'Moriarty the Patriot', 'Ryōsuke Takeuchi', 'Mystery, Historical', 'In the late 19th century, Great Britain rules over a quarter of the world. Nobles sit in their fancy homes in comfort and luxury, while the working class slaves away at their jobs. When young Albert James Moriarty''s upper-class family adopts two lower-class orphans, the cruelty the boys experience at his family''s hands cements Albert''s hatred of the nobility he was born into. He asks the older of the two boys—who has a genius mind and a killer instinct—to help him rid the world of evil, starting with Albert''s own family!...Rated:T+', 10, 'Vol 1', 'images/moriarty_vol_1.jpg', 'manga', 'Viz Media', 'crime, detective, justice, sherlock holmes, revolution', 10, 208, '2020-10-06'),
