  ('NAR001', 'Naruto', 'Masashi Kishimoto', 'Action, Adventure', 'Naruto Uzumaki is a young ninja who seeks recognition from his peers and dreams of becoming the Hokage, the leader of his village. He is determined to prove himself and protect those he cares about.', 30, 'Vol 1', 'images/naruto_vol_1.jpg', 'manga', 'Shueisha', 'ninja, friendship', 10, 192, '1999-08-03'),
